        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 312718e7-7b0c-41c6-bda0-e06e0233cf85).Image",
        "Description": "Agent,\r\rA mysterious package was discovered in a highly secure area at an ICA facility in Chongqing. (That&apos;s suspicious!) This package contained two items: A large amount of gold, and a poem implying an urgent contract to be carried out. (that&apos;s weird.) It reads:\r\rOn a cold day in Japan\rIt&apos;s our favorite hitman\rPistol, poison, accident\rSniper rifle; yell &quot;Get Bent!&quot;\r\rConsidering how and where this package was found, it seems imperative for us to carry this out as soon as possible.\r\rGood hunting",
